      "id": "c85ff4e3-1e2d-4b4e-8c4f-958d9db4aff2",
      "notes": "A cult classic where you must destroy the enemy base using a variety of turrets and troops. You start from the stone age where you have a few troops and turrets at your disposal. Gaining XP from your kills you can work your way to evolve to the next stage of war, utilizing medieval knights, modern soldiers and even beyond. In a race to overcome the opponent you must last against their evolving ways and become the reigning champion.\n\nHas a sequel.\n\n(Written by weetbix.)"
