    {
      "id": "e76eec88-dac8-4f8e-96e0-bf11ece64140",
      "notes": "Your goal is to, well, basically escape the gripping horrors of every kid's worst nightmare: SCHOOL. You start the series off escaping elementary, and subsequently, middle and high school, but after that, the games turn into... uh... something a bit unexpected, to say the least. Overall, the entire series is a well-produced, comedic ride filled to the brim with weird teachers, awkward school room layouts, and flying pigs.\n\nHas seven entries (five School, two Transfer).\n\n(Written by Telemetric.)"
    },
