      "id": "c9d30e07-e1c1-46d9-a097-1732a9683644",
      "notes": "Turn-based RPG in which you play as an amnesia-stricken zombie, trying to discover the truth of his existence. pick a class and make your way through several hub worlds, each with unique encounters and npcs. Very story-driven, especially in the second game, which even has voice acting!\n\n(Written by DrJordo.)"
